    "name": "meter",
    "description": "Report the questioning interview state to the cockpit. Call it from the questioning skill only. event \"start\" when an interview opens; \"question\" right before every ordinary AskUserQuestion, listing that call's questions with lens and move; \"stop_check\" when you print the stop check, listing the stop-check question; \"finish\" at wrap-up. Always send the full current picture: clarity, slots with state, open items with id and impact. Await the result before calling AskUserQuestion. Once started, AskUserQuestion is blocked without a fresh meter call, and after 4 answers without a stop check."
   },
